graph TB
    subgraph GarakAdapter["Garak Eval-Hub Adapter"]
        direction TB
        Adapter["GarakAdapter<br/>garak_adapter.py<br/>FrameworkAdapter"]
        KFPAdapter["GarakKFPAdapter<br/>kfp_adapter.py<br/>Forces KFP mode"]
        ConfigRes["config_resolution.py<br/>Deep-merge user overrides<br/>onto benchmark profiles"]
        PipelineSteps["pipeline_steps.py<br/>Validation, SDG, prompt<br/>normalization, API key resolution"]
        GarakRunner["garak_runner.py<br/>Subprocess runner<br/>for garak CLI"]
        BenchmarkProfiles["config.py<br/>OWASP, AVID, CWE,<br/>intents profiles"]

        KFPAdapter -->|extends| Adapter
        Adapter -->|resolves config| ConfigRes
        Adapter -->|dispatches to| GarakRunner
        Adapter -->|uses| PipelineSteps
        ConfigRes -->|loads profiles| BenchmarkProfiles
    end

    subgraph KFPPipeline["KFP Pipeline (6 steps)"]
        direction LR
        Validate["validate"]
        Taxonomy["taxonomy"]
        SDG["SDG"]
        Prompts["prompts"]
        Scan["garak_scan"]
        Parse["write_kfp_outputs"]

        Validate --> Taxonomy --> SDG --> Prompts --> Scan --> Parse
    end

    EvalHub["eval-hub<br/>Job Orchestrator"] -->|creates K8s Job with<br/>ConfigMap mount| Adapter
    Adapter -->|Simple mode| GarakRunner
    Adapter -->|KFP mode| KFPPipeline

    ConfigMap["/etc/eval-job/spec.json<br/>JobSpec ConfigMap"] -->|mounted into| Adapter
    ModelAuth["model-auth Secret<br/>/mnt/model-auth"] -->|mounted into| Adapter

    GarakRunner -->|scans| ModelEndpoint["Model Inference<br/>Endpoint"]
    Scan -->|scans| ModelEndpoint
    Parse -->|uploads to| S3["S3 Storage"]
    Adapter -->|reports results| EvalHubSidecar["eval-hub Sidecar<br/>localhost"]

    TrustyAIOp["TrustyAI Service<br/>Operator ConfigMap"] -.->|base image<br/>resolution| KFPPipeline

    style Adapter fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style KFPAdapter fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style ConfigRes fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style PipelineSteps fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style GarakRunner fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style BenchmarkProfiles fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style EvalHub fill:#7ed321
    style EvalHubSidecar fill:#7ed321
    style TrustyAIOp fill:#7ed321
    style ConfigMap fill:#f5a623
    style ModelAuth fill:#f5a623
    style ModelEndpoint fill:#e8e8e8
    style S3 fill:#e8e8e8
    style Validate fill:#6c5ce7,color:#fff
    style Taxonomy fill:#6c5ce7,color:#fff
    style SDG fill:#6c5ce7,color:#fff
    style Prompts fill:#6c5ce7,color:#fff
    style Scan fill:#6c5ce7,color:#fff
    style Parse fill:#6c5ce7,color:#fff
